{"3061930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CLUTCH", "steam_appid": 3061930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CLUTCH is a cinematic open-world action-driving game where the worlds of professional and underground street racing collide across the French Riviera.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061930/extras/df8c63cb5126818ea6210a76b77317ba.poster.avif?t=1787160624\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061930/extras/df8c63cb5126818ea6210a76b77317ba.webm?t=1787160624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061930/extras/df8c63cb5126818ea6210a76b77317ba.mp4?t=1787160624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061930/extras/113e6a9982e048903e4e12be0e96c91f.avif?t=1787160624\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061930/extras_big/113e6a9982e048903e4e12be0e96c91f.webp?t=1787160624 width=1560 height=182 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live the double life of a modern racing outlaw in a world driven by ambition, rivalry and risk. Compete in elite sanctioned racing by day, then descend into the underground after dark where cinematic getaway missions, escalating pursuits and social chaos transform every road into a story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061930/extras/7590ca1d7b1ae223af3544c163a97bf1.poster.avif?t=1787160624\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061930/extras/7590ca1d7b1ae223af3544c163a97bf1.webm?t=1787160624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061930/extras/7590ca1d7b1ae223af3544c163a97bf1.mp4?t=1787160624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061930/extras/989279fac6b5f37314c69ef6a454872f.avif?t=1787160624\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061930/extras_big/989279fac6b5f37314c69ef6a454872f.webp?t=1787160624 width=1560 height=182 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From yacht-lined harbors, to the winding coastal roads, mountains, gorges, vineyards and hilltop villages of the Riviera, CLUTCH delivers a breath taking open world built for speed, style and spectacle - where beauty and danger exist side by side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061930/extras/7c389c69df1710937db4c7efcee07033.poster.avif?t=1787160624\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061930/extras/7c389c69df1710937db4c7efcee07033.webm?t=1787160624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061930/extras/7c389c69df1710937db4c7efcee07033.mp4?t=1787160624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061930/extras/fb8d3ce5931479a1b1727002eda95854.avif?t=1787160624\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061930/extras_big/fb8d3ce5931479a1b1727002eda95854.webp?t=1787160624 width=1560 height=182 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your reputation through high-stakes race-and-chase gameplay, dynamic social sandbox events and daring escapes where no two pursuits unfold the same way. Master experimental ClutchTech mods, outsmart rivals and personalize cars defined as much by identity and lifestyle as performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061930/extras/ca301519c20d1fdf1698812290750110.poster.avif?t=1787160624\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061930/extras/ca301519c20d1fdf1698812290750110.webm?t=1787160624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061930/extras/ca301519c20d1fdf1698812290750110.mp4?t=1787160624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061930/extras/9050c62df467a00d99afcdb718753395.avif?t=1787160624\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061930/extras_big/9050c62df467a00d99afcdb718753395.webp?t=1787160624 width=1560 height=182 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of CLUTCH is a cinematic story about family, legacy and betrayal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caught between the prestige of the R1K pro circuit and the expressive underground street racing culture of the Midnight Collective, siblings Theo and Cass Martial become entangled in a conspiracy spreading across the Riviera’s racing world. As rivalries escalate and loyalties fracture, every pursuit pushes them deeper into a conflict threatening far more than their future on the track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every pursuit becomes personal.<br>Every escape becomes a story.<br>This is why we drive.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CLUTCH is a cinematic open-world action-driving game where the worlds of professional and underground street racing collide across the French Riviera.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061930/extras/df8c63cb5126818ea6210a76b77317ba.poster.avif?t=1787160624\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061930/extras/df8c63cb5126818ea6210a76b77317ba.webm?t=1787160624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061930/extras/df8c63cb5126818ea6210a76b77317ba.mp4?t=1787160624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061930/extras/113e6a9982e048903e4e12be0e96c91f.avif?t=1787160624\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061930/extras_big/113e6a9982e048903e4e12be0e96c91f.webp?t=1787160624 width=1560 height=182 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live the double life of a modern racing outlaw in a world driven by ambition, rivalry and risk. Compete in elite sanctioned racing by day, then descend into the underground after dark where cinematic getaway missions, escalating pursuits and social chaos transform every road into a story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app